# Agnes 2.5 Flash — findings by Big Pickle

> SELF-EXCLUSION: no verified public benchmark numbers were found for this exact
> model ID. Notes only — no scores are offered here.

- Source: Agnes AI/Agnes 2.5 Flash
- Date: 2026-11-13 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Agnes 2.5 Flash
- **Short description:** Generally available upgrade of Agnes 2.0 Flash from Singapore-based Agnes AI, targeting coding assistance, agent workflows, tool calling, multi-turn chat and image understanding. It is the chat/API model; the separately published "Agnes 2.5 Flash Base" is a non-instruction-tuned open-weights base checkpoint and is not this model.
- **Provider / access:** Agnes AI API, model name `agnes-2.5-flash`, base URL `https://apihub.agnes-ai.com/v1`; OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions and Responses endpoints plus an Anthropic-compatible Messages endpoint.
- **Release / knowledge:** GA (upgrade from the deprecated `agnes-2.0-flash`); knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `agnes-ai/agnes-2.5-flash` (vendor ID `agnes-2.5-flash`)
- **Context window:** 512K total; 65.5K max output (vendor docs, "Limits and Pricing").
- **Modalities:** Text and image-URL input; text out. Thinking mode, tool calling, streaming and multi-turn conversation supported. No audio/video.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** $0.05 / 1M input, $0.15 / 1M output, $0.005 / 1M cached input. An "Angel User Trial" tier lists $0 across all three (entitlement-based, not a standing free tier).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary hosted model; the open "Agnes 2.5 Flash Base" sibling is a 202B-total / ~16B-active sparse MoE (160 routed experts, 6 selected) under Apache 2.0 with a 1,048,576-token window — but no benchmark rows are published for either the base or the tuned API model.

### Raw benchmarks found

Agent / tool use:

- Terminal-Bench 2.1 / 4.0, Tau2/Tau3, GDPval-AA, OSWorld, AutomationBench, Claw-Eval, Toolathon, MCP-Atlas: no verified public score found.

Reasoning / knowledge:

- GPQA Diamond, HLE, AIME, LCR, CritPt, AA Intelligence Index: no verified public score found.
- BenchLM, Artificial Analysis, Franklin AI and The Aggregate have no page or ranked row for `agnes-2.5-flash`; searches return only vendor docs and pricing catalogues.

Coding:

- SWE-bench Verified / Pro, DeepSWE, LiveCodeBench, SciCode, HumanEval: no verified public score found.

Multimodal:

- MMMU, CharXiv, MathVision, OCRBench: no verified public score found, despite the vendor's image-understanding claims.

Long context:

- No MRCR / RULER / GraphWalks result for the 512K window.

### Why this file is excluded

The vendor documentation is complete on integration, limits, pricing and capability
prose, but publishes no measured numbers. Every independent ledger checked
(Artificial Analysis, BenchLM, Franklin AI, The Aggregate) either has no entry or
lists specs only. Vendor capability statements ("improved coding", "stronger
instruction following") are unquantified and cannot be turned into scores without
fabrication. The open-weights "Base" checkpoint is a different artifact with its
own (also unpublished) evaluation status, so its specs do not justify scores here.

### What would justify a scored file later

A vendor launch post with benchmark tables, an Artificial Analysis/BenchLM ranked
row, or any published GPQA/MMMU/SWE-bench/LiveCodeBench result attributable to
`agnes-2.5-flash` (not to the Base checkpoint or to Agnes 3.0 Flash).

